    "candidateApproach": "Replace raw on/offcurve point normal shifts by curve-aware outward dilation (stroke width2net ROUNDjoin then union to original fill), before existing transform/spacing. Scratch stage5 tested with pathops, convertConicsToQuads(0.1), Cu2Qu tolerance0.5; no tiny-contour filter/area threshold. Rendered N/A/a visually clean at200CSSpx.",
